      { question: "How much does professional branding cost?", answer: "It varies widely based on scope, but a solid brand identity package including logo, color system, typography, and guidelines typically starts around ₹25,000-₹75,000 for small and mid-sized businesses." },
      { question: "How do I know if my brand needs a refresh?", answer: "If your visuals feel dated compared to competitors, or your messaging doesn't clearly explain what makes you different, it's usually a sign a refresh — not necessarily a full rebrand — is overdue." },
      { question: "How long does it take to build a recognizable brand?", answer: "Brand recognition takes consistent effort over 2-5 years. There are no shortcuts, but every consistent touchpoint — every email, every social post, every customer interaction — compounds over time." },
      { question: "Can a small business compete with big brands on branding?", answer: "Absolutely. Small businesses often have an advantage in authenticity, personal connection, and niche expertise. You don't need a million-dollar budget — you need clarity, consistency, and genuine care for your customers." }
